# 6. Add pgvector

This is one extension I **would** add early.

[https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector](https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector)

pgvector keeps vector similarity alongside ordinary Postgres data, supports exact/approximate nearest-neighbor searches and HNSW/IVFFlat indexing. ([GitHub][3])

Embed:

```text
opportunities
services
capabilities
skills
past submissions
winning recipes
```

Then:

```text
new opportunity
      ↓
embedding
      ↓
nearest 100 historical opportunities
      ↓
how did our worker perform?
      ↓
estimate:
P(win)
cost
time
best recipe
```

This is where your WorkerKit memory becomes incredibly useful.

